{#
    A list, and the marker stands here rather than with the item.

    An item does not know if it is the third of an ordered set or a bullet of
    an unordered one. And it does not know what its own marker is worth in
    spaces. That is the indent the blocks under it need, or they leave the
    item they belong to. An auto-numbered list, `#.`, starts at no number,
    so it counts from 1.
#}
{%- autoescape false -%}
{%- set first = node.start matches '/^\\d+$/' ? node.start + 0 : 1 -%}
{%- for child in node.children -%}
{{ renderNode(child)|md_indent(node.isOrdered ? (loop.index0 + first) ~ '. ' : '- ') }}
{% endfor %}
{% endautoescape %}